+
+| Table | Rows sum to | Stated total | Status |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Finding 2 activity hours | 84.8 h | 92.2 h | `unknown` — 7.4 h unaccounted; the extraction script was not committed, so the missing class cannot be named |
